  "body": "Get on and build!\r\nAn increasingly rare opportunity to secure a section that will allow you to get on and build your home without delay.\r\nThis cross-lease title section is a half share of 827sqm, situated in the heart of Stanmore Bay, walking distance to shopping centres, cafes, restaurants, beaches and other amenities. A short drive to Gulf harbour, Orewa, Silverdale and the Northern motorway.\r\nClose to the new on/off connection to the Penlink route, currently well under construction. \r\nA Geotechnical report and house plans ready for consent application are available for inspection. Watercare have confirmed the granting of new connection for one dwelling.\r\nHouse plans ready for consent application.\r\nVendor now overseas. Must be sold!",
